{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_169_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_169","textTraditional":"一、二十年。春王正月辛亥，仲孫遬會莒人盟于向。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_169_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_169","textTraditional":"二、夏，六月庚申，公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾婁子、滕子、薛伯、〈木巳〉伯、小邾婁子盟于澶淵。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_169_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_169","textTraditional":"三、秋，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_169_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_169","textTraditional":"四、仲孫遬帥師伐邾婁。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_169_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_169","textTraditional":"五、蔡殺其大夫公子爕。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_169_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_169","textTraditional":"六、蔡公子履出奔楚。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_169_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_169","textTraditional":"七、陳侯之弟光出奔楚。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_169_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_169","textTraditional":"八、叔老如齊。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_169_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_169","textTraditional":"九、冬十月丙辰朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_169_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_169","textTraditional":"十、季孫宿如宋。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}